	<section_number>2.2-112</section_number>
	<catch_line>To whom return on warrant of Governor to be made</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any officer to whom any order or warrant of the Governor is directed shall make return to the Secretary of the Commonwealth, who shall preserve it in his office.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 2-44; 1966, c. 677, § 2.1-50; 2001, c. 844.</history>
